        {
            "name":"sound_permission",
            "value":"<body><span style='normal'> Device Co., Ltd. needs to extract voiceprint information from your voice to enhance the sound of your voice and reduce or remove any unwanted noise, so you come across crisp and clear on calls or in recordings. Your voiceprint information will not be saved, nor will it be backed up by .</span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='normal'>\nFor more information, refer to </span><span style='active'>About SOUND AI Audio Effects</span><span style='normal'>. </span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='normal'>\nBy clicking Agree, you agree to the processing of your voiceprint information.</span></body>"
        },
        {
            "name":"permission_detail",
            "value":"<body><span style='normal'>This device provides AI audio effects for audio input and output scenarios. For audio input scenarios (calling and audio recording), the Voice isolation feature is provided for picking up the voice of only one person, and the Multi-voice isolation feature is provided for picking up the voice of multiple persons, based on AI noise reduction algorithms. For audio output scenarios, the Vocal remover and Vocal isolator features are provided for audio processing during music and video playback, and the Call noise reduction feature is provided to enhance the quality of the audio from the other party during a call. </span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='title'>\nI. About Voice Isolation</span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='normal'>\nThis device offers the Voice isolation feature. It is a noise reduction and voice enhancement technology that uses voiceprint information to improve your voice signal quality during your call. Each time you speak through your device's microphone to have a call, this feature will identify your voice signals from the sound signals picked up by the microphone and enhance your voice signals while reducing or removing other interfering noise, so your speech can be transmitted more clearly to the other party. </span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='bold'>\nEvery technology has limitations and risks. Please note the following when using Voice isolation:</span><span style='normal'>\n%1$d. During the call, your voiceprint will be automatically extracted. This feature will only work if the extraction is successful.\n%2$d. If there is a high level of ambient noise for a continuous period during the call, the voiceprint extraction will be less likely to be successful, affecting the effectiveness of this feature.\n%3$d. How well the noise is reduced and your voice is enhanced during the call may vary depending the type of earphones you wear and how you wear them.\n%4$d. Only one speaker's voice can be enhanced during each call while this feature has started to work. If a different person replaces that one speaker to speak during the call, the voice signal quality of that different person will be lower. Manually disabling Voice isolation could resolve this problem.\n%5$d. Interfering human voices with similar voiceprints may not be reduced or removed as interfering noise. </span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='bold'>\nPrivacy Statement</span><span style='normal'>\nYour </span><span style='bold'>voiceprint</span><span style='normal'> will be strictly protected. Such information will not be saved, will not be backed up by , and cannot be accessed by apps. For example, when you use Voice isolation, the call app can only receive the voice signals with noise reduced and your voice enhanced, but cannot access, back up, or obtain any </span><span style='bold'>voiceprint</span><span style='normal'>.\nYou have discretion over how and where your voiceprint will be used. For example, if you do not want to use Voice isolation, you can go to </span><span style='bold'>Settings </span><span style='normal'>></span><span style='bold'> Sound </span><span style='normal'>></span><span style='bold'> Input</span><span style='normal'> and disable </span><span style='bold'>Voice isolation</span><span style='normal'>. This feature will obtain your voiceprint again the next time you use this feature. </span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='title'>\nII. About Vocal Remover and Vocal Isolator</span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='normal'>\nThis device provides the </span><span style='bold'>Vocal remover</span><span style='normal'> and </span><span style='bold'>Vocal isolator</span><span style='normal'> features. Both features are based on AI models. </span><span style='bold'>Vocal remover</span><span style='normal'> can reduce the vocal sound and retain the background sound during audio or video playback, highlighting the accompaniment in real time for sing-along. </span><span style='bold'>Vocal isolator</span><span style='normal'> can reduce the background sound and retain the vocal sound during audio or video playback, enabling you to focus on speech when playing audio clips with much background noise. </span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='bold'>\nEvery technology has limitations and risks. Please note the following when using Vocal remover and Vocal isolator:</span><span style='normal'>\n%6$d. Such features only work with certain apps and certain devices (only speakers and earphones), and their effectiveness depends on actual usage conditions.\n%7$d. Vocal remover may leave some vocal sound remaining, depending on the audio content.\n%8$d. Vocal isolator may produce a result with vocal distortion, depending on the audio content.\n%9$d. The features will be automatically disabled after the device is restarted. </span><span style='wrap'>\n-</span><span style='bold'>\nDisclaimers</span><span style='normal'>\nTo use </span><span style='bold'>Vocal remover</span><span style='normal'> and </span><span style='bold'>Vocal isolator</span><span style='normal'>, you need to manually enable them. Both features are intended for personal daily use only. If any audio copyright disputes arise due to your actions, you will be solely responsible for the consequences. </span></body>",
            "attr":{
                "priority":"translate"
            }
        },
